      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "GLOUCESTER.\nThen prithee get thee away. If for my sake\nThou wilt o’ertake us hence a mile or twain,\nI’ the way toward Dover, do it for ancient love,\nAnd bring some covering for this naked soul,\nWhich I’ll entreat to lead me.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
